                "message": "✨ feat: open indexed PDFs in DEVONthink from Finder and Alfred\n\nNew Stow package devonthink-open (macOS): dt-open looks a PDF up in the open\nDEVONthink databases with \"lookup records with path\" and opens the item link;\nPDFs that are not indexed go to a fallback viewer (Preview). dt-open-install\nbuilds \"DT Open PDF.app\" and makes it the default viewer for PDFs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX",
