                "message": "📝 docs: make devonthink-open a literate README.org that tangles\n\nREADME.org now holds the code as well as the docs: C-c C-v t (or emacs\n--batch with org-babel-tangle-file) writes dt-open, dt-open-install, the\napplet source and the settings file, byte for byte what was committed.\nAdds why an app is needed, why Hammerspoon cannot replace it, the other\noptions considered, and where the time goes (not measured).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX",
