                    "email": "noreply@anthropic.com",
                    "name": "Claude"
                },
                "message": "🔧 refactor: do the DEVONthink lookup in the applet, drop dt-open; macOS only\n\nThe applet now reads the settings, resolves symlinks (NSString), looks the\nPDF up in every open DEVONthink database and opens the item link or the\nfallback viewer itself, so a PDF open starts one process instead of four.\n.local/bin/dt-open is removed; the README records the decision, the\nalternatives and the consequences. The installer checks that DEVONthink is\ninstalled (osacompile needs its dictionary). devonthink-open is listed as\ndarwin in stow-migration/packages.tsv so migrate.sh only stows it on macOS.\nNot run on a Mac.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "07e53c4e42703cfae58f100b086e84451b4232ca",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/trees/07e53c4e42703cfae58f100b086e84451b4232ca"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/commits/7ae7daaa7dd7d21fef29e952ef951cd2e82554a2",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 07e53c4e42703cfae58f100b086e84451b4232ca\nparent 3dc34569a5d0706dae947517284978d2b5733223\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1794395863 +0200\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1794395863 +0200\n\n🔧 refactor: do the DEVONthink lookup in the applet, drop dt-open; macOS only\n\nThe applet now reads the settings, resolves symlinks (NSString), looks the\nPDF up in every open DEVONthink database and opens the item link or the\nfallback viewer itself, so a PDF open starts one process instead of four.\n.local/bin/dt-open is removed; the README records the decision, the\nalternatives and the consequences. The installer checks that DEVONthink is\ninstalled (osacompile needs its dictionary). devonthink-open is listed as\ndarwin in stow-migration/packages.tsv so migrate.sh only stows it on macOS.\nNot run on a Mac.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX\n",
